  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "First ping, 18 days with CI green. The startup crash this fixes is an inheritance accident: a sparse MLA target canonicalizes cache_dtype to an MLA-only format in place, and the DFlash drafter loaded right after walks into backend selection carrying that dtype, which no non-MLA backend serves. Would appreciate a maintainer look when convenient.\n",
      "created_at": "2026-10-12T21:10:04Z",
